    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295087,295137</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ウンディーネと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What to do with Undine?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>誰じゃ！
またわらわの眠りを
妨げるは</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Who is it!? What fool would
again disturb my rest!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>またそなたたちか……！
下らぬ用なら、
ただではすまさぬぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's you again...! If your errand
is as foolish, you will pay
dearly for approaching me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わらわと戦うじゃと？
おほほほ……
小生意気な子どもじゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You wish to do battle?
Ohohoho...
Such impudent children!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お望みどおり、
相手になろうぞ、
そして、凍え殺してやる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then I shall answer your wishes, and
become your opponent! You will
leave here as a frozen corpse!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ゆ、許してたもれ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-I plead for your forgiveness...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そなたらは人間でも
特別のようじゃ。
……また相手しよう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It appears you are truly special among
humans. ...I will be your opponent
whenever you should will it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293964</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ウンディーネ！
オレらに力を貸してくれ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Undine! Lend us
your power!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294064</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わらわと契約じゃと？
またわらわに
人の軍門に下れということか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You wish for a pact?
You ask me to submit
before the will of men?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そういうことじゃねって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh, that's not really what I meant...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや、よかろう……
ただし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No, I accept.
However...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わらわと再び戦え！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>First, you must battle me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294272</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？　な、なんでだよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Wh-Why, though...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294360</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>契約したいというなら、
その強さ、示してみよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If it's a pact you want, first you
must show me your strength!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一度戦ったじゃねーか！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Didn't we already fight you once!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>許してたもれ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I plead for your forgiveness...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ、オレたちと
契約してくれるか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, you'll form a
pact with us, then?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294620</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>承知した……
アクアマリンをここへ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, I understand...
Then, the Aquamarine Ring.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294744</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我、今、水の精に
ねがいたてまつる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here and now, I offer my request
to the Spirit of Water.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294744</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>指輪の盟約のもと、
我に精霊を従わせたまえ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>By covenant of the ring,
may this spirit obey me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294744</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我が名は&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My name is &lt;Dio&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294804</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そなたと契約を結ぼう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I hereby seal this pact with you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ははっ……話にならんわ。
契約の指輪、アクアマリンも
持っておらぬとは</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Haha... We will speak of this no
further. You fools do not possess
the Pact Ring of Aquamarine.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こたびの無礼は許してやる。
故に今すぐ下がれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I will forgive you your transgression
this once. But you must leave with
the utmost haste.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
